  "description": "The pn interface letter is a strict convex combination of the pp and nn letters and the two-strand interface law is affine, so the pn bond factor is strictly between the like-pair factors and can never be the strict maximum. The sign-mixed pattern qou-q8vl shows a positive b_3 requires (mu_pn > 1 > mu_pp, mu_nn) is therefore unreachable for any q and any admissible colour weight. Scope (b); invariant = strict convexity + affineness. A third bond family must break one of those two hypotheses.",
